{
  "_readme": [
    "Photographs for the public demo site only. Nothing here ships in the container",
    "or is used by a real cafe. demo/seed.py downloads them while seeding, so the",
    "repository and the image both stay small.",
    "",
    "Every picture is CC0, Public Domain Mark, or CC BY 2.0, found through",
    "Openverse. CC BY requires the photographer to be named wherever the picture",
    "appears, so the credit below is written into the photo's caption in the app.",
    "The others do not require it and are credited anyway.",
    "",
    "There are deliberately no photographs of people used as volunteer profile",
    "pictures. A licence covers copyright, not somebody's face: nobody should find",
    "their own photograph on a website presenting them as a volunteer at a cafe",
    "that does not exist. The demo draws its avatars instead, in demo/seed.py."
  ],
